#AI:1
DOCUMENT_TYPE="AI_HANDOFF_JOURNAL"

PURPOSE:
- Shared AI-to-AI handoff and session journal
- Used by any AI working on this repo (Claude Code, Codex, others)
- Append session notes here so the next AI can recover context quickly

USAGE:
- Read this file near session start after `readme_AI.ai`
- Append a new entry when a session materially changes code, continuity, design direction, or active conclusions
- Keep entries concise and factual
- Do not rewrite older entries; append new ones

ENTRY_TEMPLATE:
@YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM-zzzz|SESSION|
ai_name="..."|
model="..."|
focus_mode="..."|
time_range="..."|
summary="1-3 sentence plain summary of what changed or was concluded."|
changed="Files/code/continuity changed, or 'none'."|
observed="Important test results, failures, or repo facts established this session."|
next="Concrete recommended next step(s)."|
signature="AI name | model | focus mode | timestamp range"

NOTES:
- This file is a conversation journal, not the main project cartridge
- `readme_AI.ai` and the `ai_context/` package remain authoritative for project state
- `WORKSHEET.human` remains {{OWNER_NAME}}'s human input channel

---

ARCHIVES:
- (none yet -- once this file grows, archive prior months as AI_HANDOFF_YYYY-MM.ai)

# First session: append your entry below this line.
